-- ⚡ Optimized UI Update Loop (อัปเดต 20 ครั้งต่อวินาที ช่วยประหยัด CPU ได้มาก)
local lastUpdate = 0
trackConnection(RunService.Heartbeat:Connect(function(dt)
    lastUpdate = lastUpdate + dt
    if lastUpdate < 0.05 then return end -- ควบคุมรอบการทำงาน
    lastUpdate = 0

    -- 1. อัปเดต HUD ของตัวเอง
    if Settings.LocalHUD.Enabled then
        local myChar = LocalPlayer.Character
        if myChar then
            local myHum = myChar:FindFirstChild("Humanoid")
            if myHum and myHum.Health > 0 then
                myHudFrame.Visible = true
                local hpPct = math.clamp(myHum.Health / myHum.MaxHealth, 0, 1)
                myHpFill.Size = UDim2.new(hpPct, 0, 1, 0)
                myHpText.Text = string.format("❤️ HP: %d / %d", math.floor(myHum.Health), math.floor(myHum.MaxHealth))

                local stVal = myChar:GetAttribute("Stamina") or 0
                local stPct = math.clamp(stVal / Settings.ESP.MaxStamina, 0, 1)
                myStFill.Size = UDim2.new(stPct, 0, 1, 0)
                myStText.Text = string.format("⚡ STAMINA: %d / %d", math.floor(stVal), Settings.ESP.MaxStamina)
            else
                myHudFrame.Visible = false
            end
        else
            myHudFrame.Visible = false
        end
    else
        myHudFrame.Visible = false
    end

    -- 2. ESP Loop
    local myChar = LocalPlayer.Character
    local myRoot = myChar and myChar:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")

    if Settings.ESP.Enabled then
        for _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
            if player ~= LocalPlayer then
                local char = player.Character
                local hum = char and char:FindFirstChild("Humanoid")
                local targetRoot = char and char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")

                if char and char.Parent and hum and hum.Health > 0 and targetRoot then
                    local cache = ESPCache[player]
                    if not cache or cache.Character ~= char then
                        setupESP(player, char)
                        cache = ESPCache[player]
                    end

                    if cache then
                        local distance = myRoot and (myRoot.Position - targetRoot.Position).Magnitude or 0
                        if distance <= Settings.ESP.MaxDistance then
                            cache.Billboard.Enabled = true
                            cache.Highlight.Enabled = true

                            local hpPct = math.clamp(hum.Health / hum.MaxHealth, 0, 1)
                            cache.HpFill.Size = UDim2.new(hpPct, 0, 1, 0)
                            cache.HpText.Text = string.format("HP: %d/%d", math.floor(hum.Health), math.floor(hum.MaxHealth))

                            local staminaVal = char:GetAttribute("Stamina") or 0
                            local stPct = math.clamp(staminaVal / Settings.ESP.MaxStamina, 0, 1)
                            cache.StFill.Size = UDim2.new(stPct, 0, 1, 0)
                            cache.StText.Text = string.format("ST: %d [%dm]", math.floor(staminaVal), math.floor(distance))
                        else
                            cache.Billboard.Enabled = false
                            cache.Highlight.Enabled = false
                        end
                    end
                else
                    cleanupESP(player)
                end
            end
        end
    else
        for player, _ in pairs(ESPCache) do
            cleanupESP(player)
        end
    end
end))

